#!/usr/bin/env harding
#
# ArithmeticError.hrd - ArithmeticError class.

ArithmeticError := Error derive
# ArithmeticError groups failures from arithmetic that cannot produce a result
# for the given operands.
# It sits under Error so any arithmetic failure can be caught with one selector.
# DivisionByZero and Overflow are its concrete subclasses.
# Mirroring Nim's ArithmeticDefect keeps the catch structure predictable for
# readers coming from the native side.
